<HISTITEMS>
<HISTITEM authorref='_0000020DE28758D0' stid='3' tool='Emacs' dt='2014-03-04 08:20:54+01:00'>
<LABEL>1.1</LABEL>
<MOD>Services 0x23 and 0x3D: replaced proxy "data" by proxy "any".</MOD>
<REASON>Allow frames &#62; 64KB.</REASON>
</HISTITEM>
<HISTITEM authorref='_0000020DE28758D0' stid='3' tool='CANdelaStudio 8.1 Beta 1  Admin' dt='2014-07-03 12:48:31+02:00'>
<LABEL>1.2</LABEL>
<MOD>1. Added assigned text in SID-RQ
2. Added A/D Values and Engine Status DIDs
3. but do not reference them in $17.</MOD>
<REASON>1. avoid warning.
2. new 8.1 feature
3. $17 is about status info (i.e. statistical data), not about environment data / freeze frames (which are in $12)
</REASON>
</HISTITEM>
<HISTITEM authorref='_0000020DE28758D0' stid='1' tool='CANdelaStudio 8.2 Beta 2  Admin' dt='2015-06-30 12:41:52+02:00'>
<LABEL>1.3</LABEL>
<MOD>Removed German language.</MOD>
<REASON>Rework of examples.</REASON>
</HISTITEM>
<HISTITEM authorref='_0000020DE28758D0' stid='0' tool='Emacs' dt='2016-07-04 08:03:00+01:00'>
<LABEL>1.3.1</LABEL>
<MOD>Editorial change: removed duplicate and trailing blanks in names and descriptions.</MOD>
<REASON>Avoid irritating behavior with names erroneously supposed to be duplicate.</REASON>
</HISTITEM>
</HISTITEMS>
