<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>(0x3B) WriteDataByLocalIdentifier</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>This service is used by the client to write record values (data values) to a server. The data are identified by a Local Identifier.
Possible uses for this service are: 
- Clear non-volatile memory
- Reset learned values
- Set option content
- Set Vehicle Identification Number (VIN)
- Change calibration values</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>WDBLI</QUAL>
