</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>The service, EnableNormalMessageTransmission (0x29), is used to "switch on" the transmission path for all messages. This service is used in conjunction with the DisableNormalMessageTransmission (0x28) service.</TUV>
</DESC>
