<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US' struct='1'><PARA><FC fs='220'>This CANdela document template example demonstrates support for KWP in </FC>
<FC bcol='65280' b='1' fs='220'>CANdelaStudio</FC>
<FC fs='220'>.</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC fs='220'>It does not claim to be complete and is not intended for productive use!</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA><FC tcol='8388608' fs='220'>The template is based on the standards:</FC>
</PARA>
<PARA list='bul'><FC tcol='32768' fs='220'>Keyword Protocol 2000 (ISO 14230-3)</FC>
</PARA>
